{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.92},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.04,"end":28.48},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30,"end":42.72}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.96,"text":"蓄水容納部分原本會成為逕流的水。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.44,"end":5.36,"text":"它有容量且會裝滿，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.56,"end":7.88,"text":"不是無限消失的水槽。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.32,"end":10.48,"text":"模型只處理單次事件，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.8,"end":13.92,"text":"暴雨間如何排空不在目前計算中。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.04,"end":16.48,"text":"固定降雨與綠地，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.8,"end":18.32,"text":"逐步提高蓄水量，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.64,"end":23.12,"text":"找出這次事件中額外蓄水何時不再改變逕流。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.56,"end":25.52,"text":"單次事件中，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.6,"end":28.48,"text":"額外蓄水為何可能不再有幫助？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30,"end":31.12,"text":"單次事件中，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.2,"end":34.24,"text":"額外蓄水為何可能不再有幫助？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.52,"end":39.76,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.16,"end":42.72,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}